4,1,,status,Rin,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
5,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,"Um... hello. I think we should be careful about the building's limits. I'd like to look into the structural survey of the suspended bay and the maintenance log for powered displays, please.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"I agree that technical constraints are important. For my part, I want to see the five years of visitor comment slips and the weekend head counts across ten seasons.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Rin,,I want to know who is actually doing all the hard work! I'll look into the composition of the volunteer roster and the conservation lab staffing and backlog. Let's make sure we have enough people!,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I want to make sure everything actually arrives on time! I'll check the lender paperwork against shipping cut-offs and the loan transport costs over three seasons. Let's avoid any more apologies at the door!,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"It seems we are all quite focused on the logistics of the present. I shall cast my eye toward the mount-making charges and joiner's rate, as well as the evening hire bookings in the gallery.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,I... I see. Everyone has very clear goals. I just hope the building can handle whatever we choose. I'll stick with my choices for now.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"It is prudent to consider the physical limits, @Daisuke. However, understanding the public's actual response is equally vital. I believe my choices will provide the necessary context for our final decision.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Toshio, that's true! But if the people working are too tired, the visitors won't be happy anyway, right? I bet the lab is super busy! I'm really excited to see what's going on back there!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Rin, you're so right! Happy staff means happy visitors! I just don't want us to promise a cool exhibit and then have the art show up late. That would be the worst!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"Indeed, the human element is indispensable, @Rin. However, I suspect the most intriguing stories are often told by the ledger. I am curious to see where our funds truly migrate during the season.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I guess I'm just worried. If the floor can't take the weight, it doesn't matter how many people want to come. I'll just wait to see what the survey says.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"The structural integrity is a baseline requirement, @Daisuke. Once that is confirmed, we must ensure the content actually resonates. I am interested to see if our internal pride aligns with the visitors' reality.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Rin,,"@Daisuke, don't be so gloomy! I'm sure the floor is strong enough. But we can't just think about the building; we have to think about the people! I hope the roster isn't too empty!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"@Daisuke, don't worry! We'll figure it out together. I'm just hoping the paperwork shows us exactly where the shipping went wrong before, so we can make this season a total success!","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"Your optimism is quite refreshing, @Kenji. While we all hope for a seamless success, I find that a touch of skepticism regarding the budget often prevents the most unpleasant surprises. I shall await the data with anticipation.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,Thank you... for being so kind. I'll do my best to contribute. I'm looking forward to seeing the results of everyone's research so we can make a safe choice.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Toshio,,"Safety is a priority, but so is substance. I look forward to seeing if the data reveals a gap between our expectations and the visitors' experiences. Let us proceed to the findings.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Rin,,I'm ready too! I hope I find out something really important that helps everyone. Let's see if we have enough helpers to make the exhibition the best one ever!,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Kenji,,Me too! I'm super excited to see what we find. Let's make sure we pick an exhibition that actually makes it through the door on time! I'm ready for the results!,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,"A most spirited start. I believe we have covered the physical, the human, and the logistical bases quite thoroughly. I shall now retreat into my thoughts until the data arrives to enlighten us.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
